---
import Plate from "./Plate.astro";
import PenArt from "../site/PenArt.astro";
---
<Plate id="plate-iv" numeral="IV" headingId="title-iv" title="It remembers how you like things done.">
  <figure class="memory-plate">
    <div class="figure-head"><b>Fig. 4 — Two kinds of memory</b></div>
    <div class="memory-grid">
      <div class="memory-log paper-object">
        <p class="drawing-note">Across conversations</p>
        <p class="diagram-intro">with memory turned on</p>
        <table class="revisions">
          <caption class="sr-only">Preferences learned over three conversations</caption>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">Mon</th><td>You: “Report flaky tests separately.”</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Wed</th><td>You: “And always name an owner.”</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Next week</th><td>In a new conversation, it does both without being reminded.</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="thread-foldout">
        <p class="drawing-note">Within one long conversation</p>
        <div class="concertina">
          <PenArt class="pen-art pen-concertina" art="concertina" w={616} h={634} id="ink-concertina-1" />
          <div class="fold-summary paper-object">
            <ul><li>What you asked</li><li>What was decided</li><li>What’s still open</li><li>What happens next</li></ul>
            <p class="fold-next">Then it carries on: rerun the failing test.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="figure-caption memory-caption">In a long conversation, Mono Agent summarises older messages so it can keep going.</figcaption>
  </figure>
</Plate>
